# The only image in this repo (docker/Dockerfile) copies three dependency-free
# files out of scripts/. Everything else is context the daemon would upload for
# nothing — node_modules, dist/, .git and the boot wallpaper dwarf what is
# actually built. Exclude all, then re-include exactly what the Dockerfile
# COPYs; `scripts` itself is re-included first because a file inside an
# excluded directory is never reachable.
*
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/home-proxy.mjs
!scripts/proxy-server.mjs
!scripts/cloudflare-cors-proxy.mjs
